# CQ09 [Substructure & mooring] What types of anchors exist and how are they classified? (schema-level query)
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?anchorType ?label ?parent WHERE {
  ?anchorType rdfs:subClassOf+ optimar:Anchor ; rdfs:subClassOf ?parent ; rdfs:label ?label .
  FILTER(isIRI(?parent) && LANG(?label) = "en")
} ORDER BY ?parent ?anchorType
